PROPOSED, NOT APPLIED. The minimal OPEN//77 core change for Option B (in-memory decrypt). It is
dormant unless a server constructs ServerResourceHost with an IEscrowResourceProvider (only when the
per-server flag scripting.scriptgo.enabled + a deployment token are set). Flag off => null provider
=> OPEN//77 behaves exactly as today. Reviewed and applied by the OPEN//77 maintainers, in their repo
— never by SCRIPT//GO. Context lines are from base @ main on 2026-11-10.

